scrubbed (0.0.0~dev-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial .deb packaging (issue #500, slice of #61): binary, bash/zsh/fish
    completions installed to Debian-convention paths, and the release
    tarball's license-notice closure (LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, and
    the third_party/** files it references) bundled as
    /usr/share/doc/scrubbed/{copyright,THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md}. Runtime
    dependencies (libcurl4t64/libcurl4, libc6, libgcc-s1) were determined by
    running dpkg-shlibdeps against a real release binary inside real Debian
    12 (bookworm) and Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) containers, not guessed; see
    packaging/debian/README.md for the recorded evidence.

